@startuml ac_uc_3_6_channel_interest

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
  BorderColor #1565C0
  DiamondBackgroundColor #BBDEFB
  DiamondBorderColor #1565C0
}

title <size:18><b>UC-3.6 — View Channel Interest Analytics</b></size>\nActivity Diagram

|Actor|
start
:Navigate to Usage Analytics\npage — Channel Interest section;

|System|
if (Channel interest\ndata available?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Display message:\nno channel interest data available;
  stop
endif

:Retrieve channel\ninterest analytics;
note right
  V1: Channel interest = user
  looking up a channel via
  Channel Explorer or
  Growth Benchmarks.

  Selecting a channel from a
  leaderboard does NOT count.
end note

:Display aggregated\nchannel interest data;
note right
  Event contains:
  - Channel ID
  - Originating dashboard
    context/page
end note

|Actor|
:Review which channels\nare generating interest;
note right: BR-018: Analytics are\naggregated and\nprivacy-preserving
stop

@enduml
